            "icon": "science",
            "heading": "Analytical methods",
            "text": "<p>Base tests cover HPLC purity, potency, and identity. Methods follow USP validation principles. Instrument names are published after lab confirmation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "col2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "biotech",
            "heading": "Quality-control background",
            "text": "<p>Testing is performed on laboratory instrumentation operated by March Analytics, with methods drawn from pharmaceutical QC practice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "col3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "inventory_2",
            "heading": "Chain of custody",
            "text": "<p>Samples are received, logged, and tracked through reporting. The certificate of analysis applies only to the vial tested.</p>"
          }
        },
        "col4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "verified_user",
            "heading": "Independent lab",
            "text": "<p>March Analytics is operated as an independent testing laboratory. We do not sell the compounds we test.</p>"
